-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack strumpack-8.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./strumpack-8.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/strumpack-8.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/strumpack-8.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstrumpack8.1-8.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstrumpack-devel-8.1.0-X.tar.xz

